          <rdf:li>Catra's Mothers - Queens of Halfmoon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hordak (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Horde Soldiers (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bright Moon General (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Princess Alliance (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Halfmoon (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Canon Divergence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>feral Catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Feral Behavior</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Original Character Death(s)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Repressed Memories</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Recovered Memories</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Canon Compliant</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Smut</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>General Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Magjca - Magicat's language</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff and Hurt/Comfort</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>There's a little piece of smut in Chapter 29</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Doesn't really warrant an change in rating for this</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
